<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan has conducted fresh airstrikes in Syria, claiming they targeted Islamic State hideouts linked to a recent church attack that killed nine people, while Syrian authorities report civilian casualties from the attacks. Syria has condemned the strikes as a breach of its airspace and an unacceptable violation. A joint Jordan-Syria security committee is being formed to investigate the incidents. 2,732 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/27/world/middleeast/jordan-syria-strikes-attack.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOdHFuTnlKdUxQNFE3RVJQVkRyWEd6UERyNnpOelVYak0tMU1OekpmWEJySmVMY3JaN25XNWRoY2gxSkhHbjRoOFFaR3hiZk5oVnZfOFZIT2ZvUjJ0T2I0QmpUUGdzTUdVdkVnMkVTLURBNEJmNTZBOXVGTEh5R0EyVzVpS0pZU3poQmd4aFE0YnJ2SXdPejhNbUFkRndveUVUWU42OXdjZnUzbTJKY3Rkc1ozeV9FbURlR2pnREhmMUc0VkNySE9LYmltcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOUTlkRXhpdTRCZ2g4U0hDdDlkZlBWVDFkTTg2WWhBUXktS3c4akJZck9XbHdmdkpsazJiSVdjUmcxdFdZRmhITzEwRU9vS0pUNkFWSThqZlhYMUVWVnV3ZHRtRVlvdDdrSWhQSGQ0Zy1HOXhNbDEydkRscGV1eG04Q1A4a0VlajhCLTJpVTJYMVhzVzgzb0VTLUpURGl4c0VvanhreWVJcm1RUFNzRnFUMjliUlVZOURxOHlFWmVMNWNPTWsyT1p5a2trNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOMHQzNHdfOFBHVDBqV3VvMGtQVHlJcXM0R3hxZElIaTQzUXFqRVZOY2kwenhlQVJ5Q3ZDMlIteG9pZGFyaWJhV1NnMDlKMGNxT0pMMjduenU0WVpsWEdTc2ljbFF4R2pkSk5zVGdVMkJoQkx4ckt6TU9IRzBUVTQ2VXAyMEtmYjQ0ZDJWelhvaUt2UkoxOVpSdExpUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/unacceptable-violation-syria-condemns-jordan-airstrikes&quo